<title>NETHERLANDS: DE BOER TO GIVE 1997 FORECAST IN MAY.</title>
<headline>DE BOER TO GIVE 1997 FORECAST IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>ASSEN, Netherlands 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Supermarkets group De Boer Winkelbedrijven NV said on Tuesday it would only provide a forecast on its current-year business in May.</p>
<p>The company, which plans to merge with unlisted Unigro NV, earlier posted 1996 net profit of 35.2 million guilders, up from 1995's 33.2 million.</p>
<p>De Boer said it would issue a merger report on May 13, which would detail expectations for the 1997 results of the new De Boer Unigro entity. -- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
